{
  "id": "level_c18_win",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "bell_witch",
      "text": "对方自己开始拆左臂。动作很慢，像卸一件用了太久的家具。骨节一节一节松，最后一节脱开的时候有一点很轻的响声。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "bell_witch",
      "text": "她没有流血。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "bell_witch",
      "illustration": "bell_witch",
      "text": "拿着。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "bell_witch",
      "illustration": "bell_witch",
      "text": "钟响之前我是清醒的。钟一响，我就不知道会变成什么了。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "bell_witch",
      "illustration": "bell_witch",
      "text": "所以别等我清醒。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "doll",
      "text": "人偶接过骨臂。很沉。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "doll",
      "text": "祷告做完了。她没有吃。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "bell_witch",
      "illustration": "bell_witch",
      "text": "到了那里，替我看看，神到底长什么样。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "doll",
      "text": "这是第二个人对她说这句话。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "bell_witch",
      "text": "也是第二个人，说完就把眼睛闭上了。"
    }
  ]
}
